# Cursor rule adapters

Files in this directory are thin adapters for Cursor. Authoritative guidance
lives in `AGENTS.md`, `docs/`, package-local `AGENTS.md`/`CONTEXT.md`, and
`docs/standards/`.

Keep adapters short and link to the canonical source. Do not copy architecture,
formatter, translation, migration, or security policy into `.cursor/rules/`.
When an adapter conflicts with repository documentation or code, the canonical
source wins and the adapter must be corrected.

Rule attachment metadata is advisory; agents must still follow the mapped
surface routing in `index.md` before editing.
